  "releaseNotes": "2.0.0: v2 package restructuring. Consolidates the former Foundgine (root orchestrator types moved to Foundgine.Runtime; semantic primitives retained here), Foundgine.Abstractions, Foundgine.Semantics, Foundgine.Metadata, Foundgine.Planning, and Foundgine.Intent.Json packages into a single foundational package.",
